// spec: stdlib Time; 5 select; 12 Runtime panics
// panics: Channel.send
// A select send clause on a ticker's channel panics, as Channel.send does: only the ticker sends.
var ctx = Context.new()
var ticks = Time.ticker(Time.duration(milliseconds: 10), ctx)
println("before")
var sent = select {
  var ok = Channel.send(ticks, Time.fromEpochMillis(0)) { ok }
  Time.sleep(Time.duration(milliseconds: 10)) { false }
}

// expect
// exit: 1
// out: before
// err: select: Channel.send: a ticker's channel only receives
